// pydifflib.mjs — faithful pure-Node ESM port of the CPython difflib pieces
// needed by DeepDiff's string diff: str.splitlines(), SequenceMatcher
// (find_longest_match with the autojunk popular-element heuristic,
// get_matching_blocks, get_opcodes, get_grouped_opcodes) and unified_diff
// with fromfile='', tofile='', lineterm=''.
//
